%%{init: {"sequence": {"htmlLabels": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sender (Nub)
    participant R as Receiver (Nub)

    Note over S: build_outgoing(body, reliable=true)\nflags |= RELIABLE | HAS_SEQUENCE\nseq_id = next_tx_seq++\nset bit in 32-bit outstanding-ack bitmap

    S->>R: UDP [flags=0x58, seq_id=N, body]
    Note over S: ACK_TIMEOUT_MS = 700ms timer starts

    alt Ack received within 700ms
        R->>S: UDP [flags=HAS_ACKS]\nfooter: ack_count=1, ack[0]=N
        Note over S: tick() check_timeouts()\nack N matched — clear bit N\nin outstanding-ack bitmap
    else Timeout expires
        Note over S: elapsed >= 700ms\nretransmit_count++\nadded to TickActions.retransmits
        S->>R: retransmit [seq_id=N]
        Note over S: repeats up to MAX_RETRIES=20\nstrict gt check: retransmit_count > 20
    else Max retries exceeded
        Note over S: retransmit_count > 20\nChannel state = Disconnected\nadded to dead_channels
    end

    Note over S,R: Keepalive: KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL_MS=1000ms\nInactivity timeout: 300,000ms